1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,809
Two pieces of iron sheet.

2
00:00:01,809 --> 00:00:08,177
One is coated with zinc, galvanised, like the jasta roofing sheet on houses all over the hills.

3
00:00:08,177 --> 00:00:11,927
The other is coated with tin, like the inside of a food can.

4
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:15,703
Both coatings keep air and water away from the iron.

